OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells, although cloudy for
OL,7,FTayside initially. The odd isolated
OL,8,Fshower possible in the west. Feeling a
OL,9,Fbit fresher but mainly light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with clear spells through
OL,12,Fthe evening, perhaps a touch of frost
OL,13,Fdeveloping, clouding over later as
OL,14,Frain spreads north by dawn.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FA wet start for most areas and
OL,17,Fwindy around the coasts, rainn will be
OL,18,Fheavy and persistent at times during
OL,19,Fthe day, turning lighter later for
OL,20,Fwestern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
